&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;** Open to remote within the East Coast only**&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At JFrog, we’re reinventing DevOps to help the world’s greatest companies innovate -- and we want you along for the ride. This is a special place with a unique combination of brilliance, spirit and just all-around great people. Here, if you’re willing to do more, your career can take off. And since software plays a central role in everyone’s lives, you’ll be part of an important mission. Thousands of customers, including the majority of the Fortune 100, trust JFrog to manage, accelerate, and secure their software delivery from code to production -- a concept we call “liquid software.” Wouldn&#39;t it be amazing if you could join us in our journey?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Solution Engineer, Public Sector&lt;/strong&gt; at JFrog, you will be on the front lines as a trusted technical advisor, helping federal, state, and local government clients understand, evaluate, and adopt our solutions. You will work closely with our sales, product &amp;amp; engineering, customer success, and marketing teams to help customers understand the value of JFrog solutions from a technical and business perspective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Senior Solution Engineer, Public Sector in JFrog, you will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Account Executives to align technical solutions with customer goals, support presales engagements, and drive revenue through strategic value selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and navigate public sector requirements, including procurement processes, NIST guidelines, DoD frameworks (e.g., PlatformOne, IronBank), and federal compliance mandates (e.g., CMMC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver impactful demos and Proof of Value (POVs) to technical and non-technical stakeholders, showcasing how JFrog enables secure, scalable DevSecOps and MLOps practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support RFIs/RFPs and bid processes, ensuring technical accuracy and alignment with government procurement standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customers throughout the technical lifecycle, translating business goals into solution designs and collaborating with Product and Engineering to influence the roadmap based on field feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evangelize DevSecOps best practices, including the development of DoD/Federal reference architectures, and drive adoption across federal agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with industry trends, maintaining expertise in DevOps, cloud, software delivery, and emerging technologies relevant to public sector digital transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be a Senior Solution Engineer, Public Sector in JFrog, you need...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of hands-on expertise in DevOps technologies, including Docker, Kubernetes, Git, CI/CD tools, Artifactory, build tools, and modern SDLC practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years hands-on experience with vulnerability scanning (SCA, SAST, DAST), network security, container/Kubernetes security, software supply chain security (SBOMs, artifact signing, SLSA), and embedding security into CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical sales, presales, or sales engineering experience is a plus, preferably with U.S. public sector clients; experience with MEDDPICC methodology is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of public sector programs and compliance, including DoD environments, impact level classifications, NIST standards, and federal procurement models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP) and Linux environments, with ability to design hybrid architectures and scalable deployment solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to deliver POCs and technical presentations, with strong communication skills to articulate business value to both technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to clearly convey technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-centric, solution-oriented mindset and a strong passion for enabling mission success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;U.S. Citizenship is required for this role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel required - Ability to travel at least 25% throughout the U.S., meeting with clients and supporting field engagement activities across agencies and events.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Government security requirements may be needed; active security clearance a plus.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT JFROG CAN OFFER…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role has a preference for applicants based in Washington D.C.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At JFrog, base salary is only one component of our compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position has a base salary range between $160,000 to $190,000.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Base salary will be based on your skills, qualifications, experience and location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additionally, this role is eligible for discretionary bonuses or commission payments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position also includes an equity package of restricted stock units (RSU).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In addition, JFrog employees are eligible to participate in our Employee Stock Purchase Plan.JFrog provides employees comprehensive benefits including medical, dental, vision, retirement, wellness and much more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JFrog is an Equal Employment Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, creed, religion, sex, sexual orientation, national origin or nationality, ancestry, age, disability, gender identity or expression, marital status or any other category protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At JFrog, we’re reinventing DevOps to help the world’s greatest companies innovate -- and we want you along for the ride. This is a special place with a unique combination of brilliance, spirit and just all-around great people. Here, if you’re willing to do more, your career can take off. And since software plays a central role in everyone’s lives, you’ll be part of an important mission. Thousands of customers, including the majority of the Fortune 100, trust JFrog to manage, accelerate, and secure their software delivery from code to production -- a concept we call “liquid software.” Wouldn&#39;t it be amazing if you could join us in our journey?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JFrog is seeking a dynamic and visionary leader to join as the &lt;strong&gt;Regional Vice President of Strategic Solution Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;. In this pivotal role, you will be at the forefront of expanding JFrog’s presence within key accounts, driving the adoption of our cutting-edge DevOps,&amp;nbsp; DevSecOps, and MLOps solutions, and ensuring the success of our most strategic customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Regional Vice President (RVP)&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll lead a high-performing team of technical professionals, working with JFrog’s most strategic customers, forming strong customer relationships, delivering exceptional technical proofs of concept (POCs) and pre-sales guidance while acting as a trusted advisor to C-level stakeholders. Reporting directly to the VP, Strategics and Field CTO, you’ll align regional strategies with corporate objectives, ensuring revenue growth, customer happiness, strategy alignment, and market leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a RVP of Strategic Solution Engineering in JFrog you will...&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategies to drive customer happiness and revenue growth within strategic accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align team efforts with market trends, corporate goals, and competitive insights to enhance regional impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and inspire a high-performing team of technical professionals, ensuring exceptional customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with sales, marketing, product, and customer success teams to align strategies and optimize processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with executive stakeholders, positioning JFrog as a strategic partner while addressing complex challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of DevOps, DevSecOps and MLOps trends, refining strategies to address customer needs effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be an RVP of Strategic Solutions in JFrog you need...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in enterprise software/SaaS, including 5+ years managing technical or solution-oriented teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to drive seven- and eight-figure deals using methodologies like MEDDPICC and value-based selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in DevOps, DevSecOps, and pre-sales activities such as needs analysis and product demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of driving high-value deals, developing strategic account plans, and achieving corporate objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical and communication skills, data driven, with the ability to align cross-functional teams and influence stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel to engage with customers and support team success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionately drives agility and proactive approach, ensuring seamless alignment with stakeholders, customer goals, and JFrog&#39;s mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT JFROG CAN OFFER…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At JFrog, base salary is only one component of our compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position has a base salary range between $250,000 to $275,000. Base salary will be based on your skills, qualifications, experience and location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additionally, this role may be eligible for discretionary bonuses or commission payments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position also includes an equity package of restricted stock units (RSU).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In addition, JFrog employees are eligible to participate in our Employee Stock Purchase Plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;JFrog provides employees comprehensive benefits including medical, dental, vision, retirement, wellness and much more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JFrog is an Equal Employment Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, creed, religion, sex, sexual orientation, national origin or nationality, ancestry, age, disability, gender identity or expression, marital status or any other category protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come join the organization that is redefining security for the AI era. As one of the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/blog/100m-arr-in-18-months-wiz-becomes-the-fastest-growing-software-company-ever&quot;&gt; fastest-growing startups ever,&lt;/a&gt; we enable teams to secure cloud and AI applications by connecting code, cloud, and runtime into a single shared context. Trusted by security teams all over the world, we have a proven&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/wiz-wiz/reviews&quot;&gt; track record of success&lt;/a&gt; and a culture that values world-class talent. Not to mention, we&#39;re now&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/identity-security/google-completes-acquisition-of-wiz&quot;&gt; powered by Google&lt;/a&gt;, meaning we offer our customers an AI-powered platform that harnesses Google’s Threat Intelligence and Security Operations to better detect, prevent, and respond to threats across all environments, allowing for further innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Wizards from all over the globe work together to protect the infrastructure of our customers, including over 65% of the Fortune 100, who trust us to scan and secure over 230 billion files daily. We’re honored to be a leading player in a massive and growing market, and we continue to look for exceptional Wizards who are eager to make a significant impact on our team. At Wiz, you’ll have the freedom to think creatively, dream big, and use your full range of skills to contribute to our momentous growth. Come join our team and help us create secure cloud environments that allow even the best companies to move faster, all while having some fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;41&quot;&gt;Minimum qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;66&quot;&gt;Experience in a sales engineering or solutions engineering role delivering solutions to C-level executives at enterprise customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;199&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with public cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, and/or GCP).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;274&quot;&gt;Cloud security experience, including knowledge of risk-based security assessments and frameworks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;373&quot;&gt;Network engineering experience, with strong operating system, virtual machine, and container knowledge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;478&quot;&gt;Understanding of cloud identity, access, certificates, and keys.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;544&quot;&gt;Ability to travel up to 50% for customer and business engagements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;612&quot;&gt;Located in, or willing to work within, the Greater Tokyo Area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;678&quot;&gt;Preferred qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;705&quot;&gt;Experience with traditional CSPM (Cloud Security Posture Management) tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;782&quot;&gt;Experience in the SaaS (Software as a Service) industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;840&quot;&gt;Awareness of modern software delivery practices, specifically the CI/CD process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;922&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Infrastructure as Code (IaC) tools and concepts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;989&quot;&gt;Proven ability to deliver high-quality demonstrations and training experiences to channel customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1091&quot;&gt;Strong mastery of the technical sales process, with the ability to thrive in a creative technical role assisting partners to build a technical business delivery model.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1262&quot;&gt;About the job:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1276&quot;&gt;As a Solutions Engineer, you will be responsible for supporting our Mid-Market Enterprise customers and reporting to the Senior Manager, Solutions Engineering - Japan. You will partner directly with Account Executives to help change our customers&#39; views and how they approach cloud security. You will be their trusted advisor for all matters related to cloud security across AWS, Azure, and GCP. We are passionate about technical sales and helping our customers achieve the maximum value from our solution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1784&quot;&gt;Please note that we are only considering candidates in the Greater Tokyo Area at this time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1879&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1898&quot;&gt;Partner with the sales team to provide technical leadership to our customers and prospective customers in conjunction with helping our team meet their quarterly sales targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2075&quot;&gt;Provide presentations to our customers and prospective customers such as whiteboards, product demonstrations, slides, and proof of value outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2223&quot;&gt;Help our customers and prospective customers plan in-depth test plans for showing the value of the Wiz platform in their environment (proof of value).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2375&quot;&gt;Invest time in learning new product features, industry related developments, and broadening your overall technical skillset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2501&quot;&gt;Represent Wiz in technical forums such as trade shows, technical meet-ups, and industry events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the country where the position is based,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;without the need for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt; role does not offer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
